\* Mutant: the save rule before fetchAndSavePr, which kept the copy whose
\* fetchedAt, taken before the reads, was newer.  A page refresh and a crawl
\* fetch read the same PR at once, and the one that started first can read
\* the newer copy.  Same bounds as code-page-refresh, without same-second
\* updates.  RawNeverGoesBack must fail.
\* Other @...@ values are read from the code by check.sh.
SPECIFICATION Spec
CONSTANTS
    PRs = {1, 2}
    MaxTime = 1
    MaxUpdates = 2
    MaxFails = 0
    MaxHourly = 1
    Workers = 1
    StopInclusive = @StopInclusive@
    AdvanceNeedsAllSaved = @AdvanceNeedsAllSaved@
    AdvanceNeedsFullList = @AdvanceNeedsFullList@
    TargetedNeverAdvances = @TargetedNeverAdvances@
    SaveRule = "fetchedAt"
    CapAtListTime = @CapAtListTime@
    ClockAhead = FALSE
    SameSecondUpdates = FALSE
    WithRepoAdd = FALSE
    WithPageRefresh = TRUE
    PartialListing = FALSE
INVARIANTS TypeOK RawNeverGoesBack
